# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# This is display-only: git rewrites the name and address it *reports* for a
# commit, never the commit object itself, so every published revision keeps its
# hash (and so do the image tags that embed those hashes). History is
# deliberately not rewritten -- see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Commit messages".
#
# Proper Name <proper@address> Commit Name <commit@address>
